From d88e158387b42342588a5919b6ecbddca69325c6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 13:56:58 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] CR-011-Nov - One review standard for every specialty

Scoring notes removed from the review screens; the four facts only they
held (PDx POA, CPT pointers, ED level, CC/MCC weight) now sit on review
rows. Correct rows fold behind one click per section; one header and one
colour set across the practice review, batch results and auditor review.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01GAgNTxNNybv6W7GXL33G6z
